[? if npp_party_chair == "Nakayama" : “This Mumbo Jumbo”, Clueless tiredly rants, “is how we GET things done”. While our members hang photos of you on the wall, our HQ collapses with our new budget. With the lesser funds, Remma and Clueless act like men rationing food. ?]
[? if npp_party_chair == "Paisco" : Smiles light up the halls of HQ as our party members celebrate the reduction of dues. However, as you come by Clueless and Macalintal in the office, they only force out a small grin. With the trash can beside them overflowing with papers and reports. ?]
